    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "the relief of letting go... that's the only thing that sounds real right now. everything else feels like a lie. it's like i'm being forced to stay in a room that's on fire, and everyone is telling me to just try and build a new house inside it. it's exhausting. i just want the noise to stop. i just want the weight to be gone for good.",
